    "Apple Health works on-device. Tap Oura or Withings for a step-by-step guide. Shotsy has no API — you send it a file from Shotsy’s own share sheet, and tapping it explains how.": {},
    "Apple Intelligence": {},
    "Apple doesn't let apps read Screen Time, so this is the way in. A Shortcuts automation can fill it each morning if you'd rather not type it.": {},
    "As it appears in your calendar — so \"%@ on holiday – OOO\" reads as yours, and anyone else's block never counts as your meeting.": {},
