    "Grant read access so we can use your heart rate, HRV, cardio fitness and more. Your readings are stored on this phone and are never uploaded. What can be shared to improve the models is listed in Settings ▸ Data & model improvement, and nothing is sent in this build.": {},
    "Grounding uses only readings from the last 30 days. Log %lld within 30 days to ground the estimate, then %lld a month keeps it grounded. Readings already in Apple Health count automatically.": {
