    "Heart rate recovery": {},
    "Heart-attack and stroke risk is computed with published, peer-reviewed clinical equations (SCORE2 and the ASCVD Pooled Cohort Equations). Heart-health scores come from your measured fitness signals compared with age-adjusted norms and your own baseline. Blood pressure is grounded in the readings you log from a real cuff; any on-device estimate is clearly marked as experimental.": {},
