    "Needs data": {},
    "Needs your weight recorded across at least a couple of days in this window to draw against the dose.": {},
    "Never a location history. At most %lld rough places, each one a circle a few hundred metres across with a count beside it — enough to tell somewhere you always are from somewhere you don't go, and not enough to say where you were on any given day. A flagged moment keeps a rough position only until you answer it, and no longer than %lld days either way. Nothing here is ever uploaded, and the export carries the numbers and your answers without the place or your notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Never a location history. At most %1$lld rough places, each one a circle a few hundred metres across with a count beside it — enough to tell somewhere you always are from somewhere you don't go, and not enough to say where you were on any given day. A flagged moment keeps a rough position only until you answer it, and no longer than %2$lld days either way. Nothing here is ever uploaded, and the export carries the numbers and your answers without the place or your notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
