    "Nothing raw is being kept, so a future version cannot re-measure these scans — it would need you to take them again.": {},
    "Nothing the app can see stood out as moving it over this stretch — not your substances, medication, temperature or how active the day was. That is the usual answer, and a reassuring one.": {},
    "Nothing to compare these against": {},
