    "Nothing written yet. This fills in after the app next works out your %@ score.": {},
    "Nothing yet has readings landing on more than one day of your dose cycle, so there is no within-cycle shape to draw.": {},
    "Nothing yet. As you log real readings (e.g. a cuff blood pressure after an estimate) and rate insights, anonymised error metrics will collect here.": {},
    "Nothing yet. Corrections collect here as you confirm or correct what the app worked out about a calendar event, and as you log a real reading after the app estimated one.": {},
