    "iOS can save these to your iCloud Keychain and offer to fill them next time.": {},
    "iOS does not let any app read your Screen Time, so this only ever knows the days you hand it. \"View & add\" near the bottom of this card takes a day's total, and the Shortcuts automation under Settings can send it without you typing anything.": {},
    "iOS will not let the app ask again. The switches below still work and are remembered, but nothing can be delivered until notifications are turned back on for Health Insights in iOS Settings.": {},
